# Scavenger & Hunt Co. — line-ending policy.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: the working clone on Windows carries CRLF while every blob in
# the repo is LF. Without this file `git status` reports all eight tracked text
# files as fully modified (9829 insertions / 9829 deletions, zero real changes),
# which has been misread as "the local clone has drifted" in past sessions.
# `text=auto` tells git to compare against the normalised LF form, so the
# phantom diff disappears and a REAL change actually stands out.

* text=auto

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
